  "description": "Proposed internal works to Equinox Fitness Club at Level 5: convert the Private Pilates Studio into a Group Pilates Studio, all existing walls to be retained; strip out and installation of new ceiling and timber flooring. Convert Kids Club into a Private Pilates Studio, demolition of internal partitions; strip out and installation of new ceiling and timber flooring. Convert spa treatment room into 1 contrast therapy suite; including a sauna, shower and cold plunge tub; strip out and installation of new ceiling and tiled flooring. Installation of new joinery to group Pilates, Pilates and contrast therapy rooms. (NB. all works to be carried out on the previously approved design only and no invasive works to be carried out on the heritage protected interior. All works to the protected zone is cosmetic and will include making good and painting where necessary)",
